1 MCR

   Runs an image, as a foreign command does, with the rest of the line
   as the text LIB$GET_FOREIGN returns.

   Format

     MCR image [text]

2 Parameters

 image

   The image, found as RUN finds one.

 text

   The command text, treated as a foreign command's (see FOREIGN).

2 Examples

   1.$ MCR DUA1:[WORK]ECHO hello there

     Runs ECHO.EXE, which LIB$GET_FOREIGN gives "HELLO THERE".
